# Copy to `.env` for local development, or set these in the EAS build profile for a real build.
# `.env` is git-ignored; this file is not, so it holds names only.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ variables are inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build time. That is fine for a
# base URL, which is not a secret. NOTHING SECRET BELONGS IN THIS APP AT ALL: anything the app can
# read ships inside the APK and can be extracted from it. API tokens live as Worker secrets on the
# backend, never here.

# Where the licence service lives. Leave it unset and the app simply hides the online features:
# backup, in-app M-Pesa payment and moving to a new phone. Everything else works unchanged.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://herdcare-backend.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev
